        <div class="romanization">kap eop da eop seo</div>
        <div class="hangul-word">값 없다 없어</div>
        <div class="phonetic">[갑] [업따] [업써]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="example-block">
        <div class="romanization">ceom da sam da sal mi</div>
        <div class="hangul-word">젊다 삶다 살미</div>
        <div class="phonetic">[점따] [삼따] [살미]</div>
