    <div class="words-badge">단어 <span style="font-size:11px;">Words</span></div>
    <div class="dotted-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="instruction-row">
    <span>&#9679;</span>
    <span>다음 단어를 읽고 쓰십시오. Read the words and write.</span>
