        <div class="vocab-en">to have, there is</div>
        <div class="vocab-practice">있다</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="footer-row">
    <span>1-3 한글을 배워요 ③</span>
    <span>53</span>
  </div>

</div>
